Hello All,

Rainbird can supply swing joints with 1 =BD" MACME Inlets for 1 =BC" and 1 =
=BD" swing joints.

Rainbird cannot supply swing joints with 1 =BD" MACME Inlets for 1" swing j=
oints.

This is confirmed by the Rainbird product manager.

The relevance of this is the Philmac Acme fittings which are only available=
 with a 1 =BD" FACME outlet.

John


